Read `architecture.resolver` before changing resolver behavior. Preserve Queens hyphenated house numbers. Do not guess ambiguous condo units or source identifier conflicts. Effective BIN-set changes must go through the single transactional mutation boundary that owns `identifier_version` and coverage invalidation; aliases alone do not invalidate coverage.
